LANTERN — RELIQUARY URN / FULL CERAMIC SHATTER
Eight native illustrated cels. One-shot destruction with persistent debris.

RUNTIME
runtime/frames: eight transparent 1024x1024 PNG canvases.
runtime/urn_shatter_atlas.png: 4096x2048, four columns x two rows; no pixel scaling.
runtime/urn_debris.png: byte-equivalent image to final cel, hold indefinitely.
runtime/manifest.json: state names, common pivot, authored 60Hz tick durations,
camera target, per-clip pixels/metre, hashes and explicit limitations.

Timing: 6,3,4,5,5,4,6 ticks, then permanent final cel (33ticks / 0.55s before hold).
Do not loop, reverse, interpolate or reset this destruction animation. Review
movies run at 60Hz with an extended intact lead-in and 1.5s debris hold. The
painted animation has eight unique drawings, not 60 unique drawings each second.

